        <p class="bx-more reveal">Across the six networks with a published competitor figure: SSD-MobileNet v2 2,024 against 784; YOLOv5m 456 against 156; YOLOv7 212 against 100; YOLOv8s 610 against 491; YOLOv8m 235 against 149; YOLOv8l 181 against 64. Source: axelera.ai/metis-aipu-benchmarks, checked 27 Aug 2026.</p>
