      </header>

      <div class="fg slab reveal">
        
        <div class="slab-col">
          <p class="badge badge-now">Shipping</p>
          <div class="slab-media"><img decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/hubfs/axelera-home-2026/media/products/metis-die-1000.webp" srcset="/hubfs/axelera-home-2026/media/products/metis-die-640.webp 640w, /hubfs/axelera-home-2026/media/products/metis-die-1000.webp 1000w" sizes="(max-width:900px) 80vw, 26vw" alt="Metis AIPU package" width="1000" height="1000"></div>
          
          <h3>Metis<sup>®</sup></h3>
          <p class="slab-line">Quad-core AIPU</p>
          
          <p class="slab-peak"><strong data-count="214">214</strong><span> TOPS per chip</span><a class="kv-src" href="#silicon-sources" title="Source 1">1</a></p>
          <div class="bar"><span style="--w:34%"></span></div>
          <dl class="kv">
            <div><dt>Typical application power</dt><dd>3.5-9 W<a class="kv-src" href="#silicon-sources" title="Source 4">4</a></dd></div>
            <div><dt>Memory</dt><dd>up to 16 GB per chip<a class="kv-src" href="#silicon-sources" title="Source 4">4</a></dd></div>
            <div class="is-pending"><dt>LLM capacity</dt><dd>up to 8B parameters <span class="kv-src is-pending">source pending</span></dd></div>
            <div><dt>YOLOv8l</dt><dd>181 FPS<a class="kv-src" href="#silicon-sources" title="Source 3">3</a></dd></div>
            <div><dt>ResNet-50</dt><dd>up to 3,200 FPS<a class="kv-src" href="#silicon-sources" title="Source 1">1</a></dd></div>
          </dl>
          
        </div>
        
        <div class="slab-col slab-featured">
          <p class="badge badge-next">Next generation</p>
          <div class="slab-media"><img decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="https://axelera.ai/hs-fs/hubfs/Europa-AIPU-web.png?width=2803&amp;height=2791&amp;name=Europa-AIPU-web.png" alt="Europa-AIPU-web" width="2803" height="2791" srcset="https://axelera.ai/hs-fs/hubfs/Europa-AIPU-web.png?width=1402&amp;height=1396&amp;name=Europa-AIPU-web.png 1402w, https://axelera.ai/hs-fs/hubfs/Europa-AIPU-web.png?width=2803&amp;height=2791&amp;name=Europa-AIPU-web.png 2803w, https://axelera.ai/hs-fs/hubfs/Europa-AIPU-web.png?width=4205&amp;height=4187&amp;name=Europa-AIPU-web.png 4205w, https://axelera.ai/hs-fs/hubfs/Europa-AIPU-web.png?width=5606&amp;height=5582&amp;name=Europa-AIPU-web.png 5606w, https://axelera.ai/hs-fs/hubfs/Europa-AIPU-web.png?width=7008&amp;height=6978&amp;name=Europa-AIPU-web.png 7008w, https://axelera.ai/hs-fs/hubfs/Europa-AIPU-web.png?width=8409&amp;height=8373&amp;name=Europa-AIPU-web.png 8409w" sizes="(max-width: 2803px) 100vw, 2803px"></div>
          
          <h3>Europa<sup>™</sup></h3>
          <p class="slab-line">Double the cores, sixteen vector units, pre/post-processing on die.</p>
          
          <p class="slab-peak"><strong data-count="629">629</strong><span> TOPS per chip</span><a class="kv-src" href="#silicon-sources" title="Source 2">2</a></p>
          <div class="bar"><span style="--w:100%"></span></div>
          <dl class="kv">
            <div><dt>TDP</dt><dd>45 W per card<a class="kv-src" href="#silicon-sources" title="Source 2">2</a></dd></div>
            <div><dt>Typical power</dt><dd>30-40 W<a class="kv-src" href="#silicon-sources" title="Source 4">4</a></dd></div>
            <div><dt>Memory</dt><dd>up to 64 GB per chip<a class="kv-src" href="#silicon-sources" title="Source 4">4</a></dd></div>
            <div><dt>LLM capacity</dt><dd>up to 32B parameters<a class="kv-src" href="#silicon-sources" title="Source 4, single-chip figure">4</a></dd></div>
            <div class="is-pending is-valueless"><dt>YOLOv8l</dt><dd><span class="kv-src is-pending">to be confirmed</span></dd></div>
            <div><dt>Qwen3-30B-A3B</dt><dd>53.5 tokens/s<span class="kv-qual">, simulated</span><a class="kv-src" href="#silicon-sources" title="Source 4">4</a></dd></div>
          </dl>
          
        </div>
        
        <div class="slab-col">
          <p class="badge badge-later">Announced</p>
          <div class="slab-media slab-media-abstract" aria-hidden="true"><div class="chiplets"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></div>
          
          <h3>Titania<sup>™</sup></h3>
          <p class="slab-line">A chiplet that scales the architecture into HPC.</p>
          
        </div>
        
      </div>
      <ol class="slab-sources reveal" id="silicon-sources" aria-label="Sources for the figures above">
        <li><span class="kv-src">1</span>Metis product page, axelera.ai/ai-accelerators/aipu/metis, checked 27 Aug 2026.</li>
        <li><span class="kv-src">2</span>Europa product page and the October 2025 announcement, checked 27 Aug 2026. The 45 W is the published TDP.</li>
        <li><span class="kv-src">3</span>axelera.ai/metis-aipu-benchmarks, checked 27 Aug 2026.</li>
        <li><span class="kv-src">4</span>Axelera performance engineering, confirmed 1 Sep 2026. The Qwen3-30B-A3B figure is a pre-silicon simulation: 1,024-token context at W8A8 with an 8-bit KV cache, single user, one chip. LLM capacity is a single-chip figure; model size scales with chip count in multi-chip cards and systems.</li>
        <li><span class="kv-src is-pending">source pending</span>Not yet confirmed by Axelera's performance engineering.</li>
        <li><span class="kv-src is-pending">to be confirmed</span>Measured on Europa silicon, held until Axelera signs off its Europa figures.</li>
      </ol>

