    <section data-glass-section="software" class="section" id="software">
      <header class="section-head reveal">
        <p class="eyebrow">From model to production, powered by the Voyager® SDK</p>
        <h2>Everything you need to build, faster.</h2>
        <p class="section-lede">One toolchain, every deployment: describe your pipeline in YAML and the Voyager SDK compiles, quantizes and runs it on any Axelera product line, with no retraining required.</p>
      </header>

      <div class="vgr-grid">

        <article class="fg card vgr tilt reveal" data-tilt>
          <span class="vgr-logo-chip"><img decoding="async" src="/hubfs/axelera-home-2026/media/logo/voyager-sdk.svg" alt="Voyager SDK" height="34"></span>
          <h3>Voyager SDK: the end-to-end software stack</h3>
          <p>Purpose-built for AI inference: a declarative YAML pipeline language, 100+ supported models through one toolchain, and API compatibility with industry standards. From idea to deployment quickly, with deep customization when you need it.</p>
          <div class="vgr-links">
            <a class="prod-cta" href="/ai-software/voyager-sdk?hsLang=en" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Voyager SDK →</a>
            <a class="prod-cta" href="https://docs.axelera.ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Documentation →</a>
            <a class="prod-cta" href="/ai-software/model-zoo?hsLang=en" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Model Zoo →</a>
