        </article>

        <article class="fg card vgr tilt reveal" data-tilt style="--rd:.12s">
          <span class="vgr-logo-chip"><img decoding="async" src="https://axelera.ai/hs-fs/hubfs/axelera-wingman-wordmark.png?height=34&amp;name=axelera-wingman-wordmark.png" alt="axelera-wingman-wordmark" height="34"></span>
          <h3>Axelera Wingman: the agentic AI platform</h3>
          <p>Purpose-built for Axelera hardware with deep, curated knowledge of the SDK and documentation: Axelera Wingman builds, debugs and optimizes inference pipelines from natural language, at 20 to 30% higher accuracy than general-purpose AI coding tools.</p>
          <div class="vgr-links">
            <a class="btn btn-gold" href="https://chat.wingman.axelera.ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open Axelera Wingman</a>
          </div>
        </article>

